b3e23bb0bdf5f8c11a850ebc23ed4101d51c1f5075909fdd45beda00d113"},"examples":[["examples/native_function_children.lean",9,3]],"message":"feat(inductive): check function-valued recursive children and accessibility elimination\n\nConstruct dependent function-valued induction hypotheses and lambda-wrapped recursive rules. Independently reconstruct positivity, universes, flags and full rule bodies in the checker. Preserve negative/nested refusals and function-field scope. Enable source matches, induction, and accessibility-style elimination into dependent data without a primary kernel change or new axiom.\n\nSix adversarial checker tests, nine source tests and one installed CLI regression pass with the full five-package suite, scoped Clippy and workspace compilation. Remote gates repeat before non-forced publication. Automatic well-founded termination inference remains separate. Related: fln-qb5, fln-kpd."}
